            <field name="gap_analysis">missing</field>
            <field name="impact_severity_score">2</field>
            <field name="financial_severity_score">2</field>
            <field name="justification">The site is not located near any protected or sensitive biodiversity area, and no material impacts on ecosystems have been identified in the current risk assessment. Monitored on an ongoing basis in case of future site expansions.</field>
